w></munder><mstyle displaystyle=\"true\" scriptlevel=\"0\"><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>h</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi></mrow><mi>h</mi></mfrac></mstyle></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd></mtd><mtd><mi></mi><mo>=</mo><munder><mo data-mjx-texclass=\"OP\" movablelimits=\"true\">lim</mo><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mi>h</mi><mo accent=\"false\" stretchy=\"false\">→</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></munder><mstyle displaystyle=\"true\" scriptlevel=\"0\"><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>h</mi></mrow><mi>h</mi></mfrac></mstyle></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd></mtd><mtd><mi></mi><mo>=</mo><munder><mo data-mjx-texclass=\"OP\" movablelimits=\"true\">lim</mo><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mi>h</mi><mo accent=\"false\" stretchy=\"false\">→</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></munder><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mn>2</mn></mrow></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd></mtd><mtd><mi></mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2.</mn></mtd></mtr></mtable></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container></p>\n<p>Therefore, <mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" jax=\"CHTML\" tabindex=\"0\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"35\" style=\"font-size: 119.4%; position: relative;\"><mjx-math class=\"MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-msup><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D453 TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi><mjx-script style=\"vertical-align: 0.363em; margin-left: 0.053em;\"><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-var\" size=\"s\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c2032\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo></mjx-script></mjx-msup><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c28\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D465 TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c29\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\" space=\"4\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c3D\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\" space=\"4\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c32\"></mjx-c><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c2E\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>f</mi><mo data-mjx-alternate=\"1\">′</mo></msu